---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionAbstractSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: onlyLegion AND whenNotPaused AND whenSaleNotCanceled AND whenRefundPeriodIsOver AND whenSaleResultsNotPublished
    q_guard --> q_verify: guards pass
    q_verify --> q_revert_transfer: hasRefunded OR hasSettled OR !hasClaimedExcess
    q_revert_transfer --> [*]: revert LegionSale__UnableToTransferInvestorPosition()
    q_verify --> q_check_receiver: position transferable
    q_check_receiver --> q_merge: receiver already has positionId != 0
    q_merge --> q_revert_merge: receiver hasRefunded OR hasSettled OR !hasClaimedExcess
    q_revert_merge --> [*]: revert LegionSale__UnableToMergeInvestorPosition()
    q_merge --> q_update_merge: receiver position valid for merge
    q_update_merge --> q_delete: investedCapital += burned.investedCapital; cachedTokenAllocationRate += burned.cachedTokenAllocationRate; cachedInvestAmount += burned.cachedInvestAmount
    q_delete --> [*]: delete s_investorPositions[positionId]; burn NFT
    q_check_receiver --> q_simple_transfer: receiver has no position (positionId == 0)
    q_simple_transfer --> [*]: unlock and transfer NFT; update mappings

    note right of q_check_receiver
        INV-001: position transfer only before sale results are published
        INV-002: merge adds capital and allocation rates from burned position
        INV-003: burned position is fully deleted after merge
        INV-004: simple transfer preserves existing position data with new owner
    end note
